Html Tags
------------------

<h1> => create the main/big heading
<h2> => create the second level heading
<h3> => create the third level heading
<h4> => create the fourth level heading
<h5> => create the fifth level heading
<h6> => create the sixth level heading
<p> => create the the paragraphs

<b> => make the bold text
<i> => make the italic text
<u> => draw the underline below of the text
<strike> => cancel the text
<mark>=> highlight the text with yellow color

<sup> => used to move the text base line above
                  or
        any text is covert into power.

<sub> => used to move the text base line below
                  or
        any text is covert into base.

<pre> => used to display the information
    on a webpage as it is how you written

<code> =>The code element represents a fragment of computer code.

<var>=>The var element represents a variable.

<font>=> used to change textcolor,textsize,textlook


<br>=> used to break the text or line. it is  a unpair tag.

<img> => used to add the images on a webpage.it is  a unpair tag.

it comes multiple attributes
-------------------------------
src="image path"
width="set the image width"
height="set the image height"
border="set the image height"
alt="set the alternate the if image not found" (FAQ)

<marquee> => html marquee tag used to scroll the text or images
on a webpage.by default scroll the text on a webpage right to left.(FAQ)

it comes multiple attributes
-------------------------------
bgcolor="set the background color"
behavior="change the behavior . by default behavior is scroll"
behavior="scroll(default)| alternate |slide"

direction="change the direction"
direction="left(scroll),right,up,down "
scrollamount="control the speed of the text"


Html List Tags
-------------------
html List  tags are divided into three types


1.ordered List
2.unodered List
3.define List


1.ordered List
----------------
html ordered list used to keep the related items along with numbers
in order.
it is define with <ol> tag.
<ol> comes with child tag , that is <li> tag for keep the content or text.


ordered List comes with attributes
--------------------------------------

type="change the number format to other format"

type="a or A or I or i"

start="you can start the list with any number"
start="96 or 101 or 74"


